    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nAPP Kirrane Auctioneering present an exceptional opportunity to acquire a high preforming investment property in the renowned village of Knock, Co. Mayo. Offered for sale as one complete package, these two spacious first floor apartments provide an excellent opportunity for investors seeking an established asset with immediate rental income.\n\nBoth apartments are currently tenanted, generating a strong rental yield and are presented in excellent condition. Accessed via a private entrance, each apartment offers generous accommodation rarely found in modern apartment developments, making them highly attractive to tenants. \n\nInternally, each apartment comprises a bright and spacious sitting room and dining area, a separate fully fitted kitchen, a practical utility space, two generous double bedrooms and a large family bathroom. the apartments are fully furnished, tastefully decorated and finished to a high standard allowing for a seamless investment with no immediate expenditure required.\n\nThe properties are fitted with electric heating and benefit from their prime location just a short stroll form Knock Basilica, shops, cafes, local amenities, and public transport links. Their central location ensures continued demand from both long term tenants and those seeking accommodation close to one of Irelands most famous pilgrimage destinations.\n\nA significant advantage of this investment is that there is no management company in place, meaning there are no annual management fees, helping to maximise your return on investment.\n\nWhether you are looking to expand your existing portfolio or make your first investment purchase, this is a rare opportunity to acquire tow income producing apartments in a sought after location. Available for sale together as one investment package, these properties offer immediate income, generous accommodation, and excellent long term potential.\n\nfor further information or to arrange a viewing please contact the Sole Selling Agents APP Kirrane Auctioneering - where everything we touch turns to SOLD.\n\nPlease Note: These particulars are for general information only for this property. The details contained are not to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the property details, neither APP Kirrane Auctioneering or the vendor accept any liability for the details contained in the description of the property. The interested persons must satisfy themselves by viewing the property or employ somebody to inspect the property on their behalf. No Auctioneer or Staff Member employed by APP Kirrane Auctioneering in either; Main Street, Ballyhaunis, Co. Mayo or Bohermore, Galway has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
